{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-11-01 07:00:00', 'title': 'EMERSON COMPLETES THE SALE OF THE INSINKERATOR BUSINESS TO WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SALE OF ITS INSINKERATOR® BUSINESS TO WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION (NYSE: WHR) FOR $3.0 BILLION.'}